libam7xxx
------------------------------------------
libam7xxx is an Open Source library to communicate via USB with projectors and
Digital Picture Frames based on the Actions Micro AM7XXX family if ICs.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libam7xxx-devel-0.1.7+git20180302-1bl2
  libam7xxx0.1-0.1.7+git20180302-1bl2
  libavcodec63-9.0.2-3
  libavdevice63-9.0.2-3
  libavformat63-9.0.2-3
  libavutil61-9.0.2-3
  libswscale10-9.0.2-3
  libusb1.0-1.0.21-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  libxcb1-1.17.0-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  asciidoc-10.2.1-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  docbook-xml45-4.5-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libavcodec-devel-9.0.2-3
  libavdevice-devel-9.0.2-3
  libavformat-devel-9.0.2-3
  libavutil-devel-9.0.2-3
  libswscale-devel-9.0.2-3
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  libxcb-devel-1.17.0-2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://git.ao2.it/libam7xxx.git/

Canonical download:
  https://git.ao2.it/libam7xxx.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libam7xxx-0.1.7+git20180302-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libam7xxx-0.1.7+git20180302-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libam7xxx-0.1.7+git20180302-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libam7xxx-0.1.7+git20180302-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libam7xxx0.1-0.1.7+git20180302-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libam7xxx-devel-0.1.7+git20180302-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libam7xxx)
  /usr/bin/am7xxx-modeswitch.exe
  /usr/bin/am7xxx-play.exe
  /usr/bin/picoproj.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libam7xxx.README
  /usr/share/doc/libam7xxx/HACKING.asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libam7xxx/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libam7xxx/README.asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libam7xxx/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/am7xxx-modeswitch.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/am7xxx-play.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/picoproj.1.gz

(libam7xxx0.1)
  /usr/bin/cygam7xxx-0.1.dll

(libam7xxx-devel)
  /usr/include/am7xxx.h
  /usr/lib/libam7xxx.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libam7xxx.pc

